    - Structured data detection (JSON validity, field count)
    - Execution status codes (0=success, 3=finish, 4=give_up)
    - Error pattern matching in observation text
    - Depth efficiency (shorter chains preferred)
    - Loop/repetition penalty from action history
    - Sibling diversity check
    """
    score = 0.0

